{"id":"53133cedc313983a","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-zfc-model10-interpretation-map.md","title":"ZFC Model10 Interpretation Map","display":"df-zfc-model10-interpretation-map — ZFC Model10 Interpretation Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model10-interpretation-map","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model10-interpretation-map","58-df-zfc-model6-interpretation-map"],"display":"df-zfc-model10-interpretation-map — ZFC Model10 Interpretation Map","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-model2-interpretation-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model10-interpretation-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model10-interpretation-map</span><span>58-df-zfc-model6-interpretation-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model10-interpretation-map — ZFC Model10 Interpretation Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5422fa2d4aa74b03\" href=\"?note=5422fa2d4aa74b03\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-zfc-model2-interpretation-function.md\">../batch12/58-df-zfc-model2-interpretation-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,L,\\mathcal M,U,C,F,R,a\\in V\">\\(I,L,\\mathcal M,U,C,F,R,a\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L=\\langle C,F,R,a\\rangle\">\\(L=\\langle C,F,R,a\\rangle\\)</span> (language-signature code)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,L)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\)</span> (structure predicate and universe, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{cst}},I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{fun},n},I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{rel},n}\">\\(I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{cst}},I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{fun},n},I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{rel},n}\\)</span> (interpretation components of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\">\\(\\mathcal M\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel2InterpretationFunction}_S(I,L,U)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel2InterpretationFunction}_S(I,L,U)\\)</span> (interpretation-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5422fa2d4aa74b03\" href=\"?note=5422fa2d4aa74b03\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-zfc-model2-interpretation-function.md\">../batch12/58-df-zfc-model2-interpretation-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel10InterpretationMap}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel10InterpretationMap}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel6InterpretationMap}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel6InterpretationMap}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model10\\text{-}interpretation\\text{-}map}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel10InterpretationMap}_S(I,L,\\mathcal M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists C,F,R,a\\;\\Bigl(\nL=\\langle C,F,R,a\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,L)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcModel2InterpretationFunction}_S\n\\bigl(I,L,\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall c\\in C\\;\n\\bigl(I(c)=I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{cst}}(c)\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall f\\in F\\;\n\\bigl(I(f)=I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{fun},a(f)}(f)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall r\\in R\\;\n\\bigl(I(r)=I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{rel},a(r)}(r)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model10\\text{-}interpretation\\text{-}map}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel10InterpretationMap}_S(I,L,\\mathcal M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists C,F,R,a\\;\\Bigl(\nL=\\langle C,F,R,a\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,L)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcModel2InterpretationFunction}_S\n\\bigl(I,L,\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall c\\in C\\;\n\\bigl(I(c)=I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{cst}}(c)\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall f\\in F\\;\n\\bigl(I(f)=I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{fun},a(f)}(f)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall r\\in R\\;\n\\bigl(I(r)=I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{rel},a(r)}(r)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model6\\text{-}interpretation\\text{-}map}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel6InterpretationMap}_S(L,U,I)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel2InterpretationFunction}_S(I,L,U).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model6\\text{-}interpretation\\text{-}map}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel6InterpretationMap}_S(L,U,I)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel2InterpretationFunction}_S(I,L,U).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The model10 predicate states that the set-coded interpretation function is exactly the interpretation carried by the structure.</li>\n<li>The model6 argument order is retained as an alias of the canonical interpretation-function predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-zfc-model2-interpretation-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"5422fa2d4aa74b03","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-model2-interpretation-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,L)$ and $\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)$ (structure predicate and universe, see [[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-zfc-model2-interpretation-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"5422fa2d4aa74b03","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcModel2InterpretationFunction}_S(I,L,U)$ (interpretation-function predicate, see [[../batch12/58-df-zfc-model2-interpretation-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I,L,\\mathcal M,U,C,F,R,a\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"L=\\langle C,F,R,a\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)","display":false},{"tex":"I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{cst}},I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{fun},n},I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{rel},n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel2InterpretationFunction}_S(I,L,U)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel10InterpretationMap}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel6InterpretationMap}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model10\\text{-}interpretation\\text{-}map}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel10InterpretationMap}_S(I,L,\\mathcal M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists C,F,R,a\\;\\Bigl(\nL=\\langle C,F,R,a\\rangle\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,L)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcModel2InterpretationFunction}_S\n\\bigl(I,L,\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall c\\in C\\;\n\\bigl(I(c)=I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{cst}}(c)\\bigr)\n\\land\\forall f\\in F\\;\n\\bigl(I(f)=I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{fun},a(f)}(f)\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall r\\in R\\;\n\\bigl(I(r)=I^{\\mathcal M}_{\\mathrm{rel},a(r)}(r)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model6\\text{-}interpretation\\text{-}map}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel6InterpretationMap}_S(L,U,I)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel2InterpretationFunction}_S(I,L,U).","display":true}],"bytes":2227,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2725","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-model10-interpretation-map.md|58-df-zfc-model10-interpretation-map]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d9b8711cda3f31ca","5422fa2d4aa74b03"]}